  "rulesText": "Wondrous Item, Uncommon (Requires Attunement)\n\nThe medallion has 5 charges. While wearing it, you can expend 1 charge to cast Detect Thoughts (save DC 13) from it. The medallion regains 1d4 expended charges daily at dawn."
